window.SOURATE_DATA = {"numSourate":56,"nomSourate":"Al-Waqi'ah","nomFr":"L'inévitable","nomEn":"The Inevitable","nomArabe":"الواقعة","lieu":"La Mecque","lieuEn":"Makkah","typeSourateLabel":"Sourate Mecquoise","typeSourateLabelEn":"Meccan Surah","typeSourateClasse":"mecquoise","ordreRev":46,"nbVersets":96,"versets":[{"numVerset":1,"texteArabe":"بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَانِ الرَّحِيمِ إِذَا وَقَعَتِ الْوَاقِعَةُ","tradPropre":"Quand l'événement (le Jugement) arrivera,","tradEn":"When the Occurrence occurs,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Lorsque la Résurrection surviendra irrémédiablement.","explicationEn":"1. When the inevitable rising will occur.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056001","lienPrecedent":"sourate-55-verset-78.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-2.html"},{"numVerset":2,"texteArabe":"لَيْسَ لِوَقْعَتِهَا كَاذِبَةٌ","tradPropre":"nul ne traitera sa venue de mensonge.","tradEn":"There is, at its occurrence, no denial.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Aucune âme n’en niera la réalité, contrairement à ce qui se passait dans le bas monde.","explicationEn":"2. There will be no soul that denies it like how it used to deny in the world.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056002","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-1.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-3.html"},{"numVerset":3,"texteArabe":"خَافِضَةٌ رَافِعَةٌ","tradPropre":"Il abaissera (les uns), il élèvera (les autres).","tradEn":"It will bring down [some] and raise up [others].","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Elle abaissera les mécréants pervers en les faisant entrer en Enfer et élèvera les croyants pieux en les faisant entrer au Paradis.","explicationEn":"3. It will bring the sinful disbelievers low by entering them into the Fire, and it will raise the mindful believers high by entering them into Paradise.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056003","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-2.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-4.html"},{"numVerset":4,"texteArabe":"إِذَا رُجَّتِ الْأَرْضُ رَجًّا","tradPropre":"Quand la terre sera secouée violemment,","tradEn":"When the earth is shaken with convulsion","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Lorsque la Terre sera violemment secouée.","explicationEn":"4. When the earth is shaken violently.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056004","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-3.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-5.html"},{"numVerset":5,"texteArabe":"وَبُسَّتِ الْجِبَالُ بَسًّا","tradPropre":"et les montagnes seront réduites en miettes,","tradEn":"And the mountains are broken down, crumbling","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Et que les montagnes seront réduites en miettes.","explicationEn":"5. And the mountains are completely crushed.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056005","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-4.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-6.html"},{"numVerset":6,"texteArabe":"فَكَانَتْ هَبَاءً مُنْبَثًّا","tradPropre":"et qu'elles deviendront poussière éparpillée","tradEn":"And become dust dispersing,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Au point de devenir une poussière en suspension dans l’air qui ne se fixe pas.","explicationEn":"6. Due to this crushing they will become scattered dust.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056006","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-5.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-7.html"},{"numVerset":7,"texteArabe":"وَكُنْتُمْ أَزْوَاجًا ثَلَاثَةً","tradPropre":"alors vous serez trois catégories:","tradEn":"And you become [of] three kinds:","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ce Jour-là, vous serez partagés en trois catégories:","explicationEn":"7. You will be in three categories on that day.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056007","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-6.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-8.html"},{"numVerset":8,"texteArabe":"فَأَصْحَابُ الْمَيْمَنَةِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الْمَيْمَنَةِ","tradPropre":"les gens de la droite - que sont les gens de la droite?","tradEn":"Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Les gens de la droite, c’est-à-dire ceux qui prendront leurs livres de la main droite. Que leur rang sera élevé et éminent!","explicationEn":"8. The people of the right hand, who will receive their books in their right hands. How high and great will be their rank!","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056008","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-7.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-9.html"},{"numVerset":9,"texteArabe":"وَأَصْحَابُ الْمَشْأَمَةِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الْمَشْأَمَةِ","tradPropre":"Et les gens de la gauche - que sont les gens de la gauche?","tradEn":"And the companions of the left - what are companions of the left?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Les gens de la gauche, c’est-à-dire ceux qui prendront leurs livres de la main gauche. Que leur rang sera vil et mauvais!","explicationEn":"9. The people of the left hand, who will receive their books in their left hands. How despicable and wretched will be their ranks.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056009","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-8.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-10.html"},{"numVerset":10,"texteArabe":"وَالسَّابِقُونَ السَّابِقُونَ","tradPropre":"Les premiers (à suivre les ordres d'Allah sur la terre) ce sont eux qui seront les premiers (dans l'au-delà)","tradEn":"And the forerunners, the forerunners -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ceux qui étaient les premiers à faire le bien dans le bas monde seront les premiers à entrer au Paradis.","explicationEn":"10. Those who were foremost in doing good deeds in the world they will be foremost in the afterlife to enter Paradise.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056010","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-9.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-11.html"},{"numVerset":11,"texteArabe":"أُولَائِكَ الْمُقَرَّبُونَ","tradPropre":"Ce sont ceux-là les plus rapprochés d'Allah","tradEn":"Those are the ones brought near [to Allāh]","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ceux-là seront les plus rapprochés d’Allah.","explicationEn":"11. They are the ones who will be brought close to Allah.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056011","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-10.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-12.html"},{"numVerset":12,"texteArabe":"فِي جَنَّاتِ النَّعِيمِ","tradPropre":"dans les Jardins des délices,","tradEn":"In the Gardens of Pleasure,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront dans les Jardins où ils jouiront de nombreux délices.","explicationEn":"12. In gardens of delight, they will enjoy different types of delight.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056012","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-11.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-13.html"},{"numVerset":13,"texteArabe":"ثُلَّةٌ مِنَ الْأَوَّلِينَ","tradPropre":"une multitude d'élus parmi les premières [générations],","tradEn":"A [large] company of the former peoples","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront issus en grand nombre de cette génération et des générations précédentes.","explicationEn":"13. A group from this nation and from previous nation.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056013","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-12.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-14.html"},{"numVerset":14,"texteArabe":"وَقَلِيلٌ مِنَ الْآخِرِينَ","tradPropre":"et un petit nombre parmi les dernières [générations],","tradEn":"And a few of the later peoples,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Mais seul un petit nombre des gens de la Fin des Temps compteront parmi ces rapprochés.","explicationEn":"14. A few people at the end of time will be the foremost ones that are brought close.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056014","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-13.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-15.html"},{"numVerset":15,"texteArabe":"عَلَىٰ سُرُرٍ مَوْضُونَةٍ","tradPropre":"sur des lits ornés [d'or et de pierreries],","tradEn":"On thrones woven [with ornament],","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront installés sur des lits ornés d’or.","explicationEn":"15. On couches woven with gold.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056015","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-14.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-16.html"},{"numVerset":16,"texteArabe":"مُتَّكِئِينَ عَلَيْهَا مُتَقَابِلِينَ","tradPropre":"s'y accoudant et se faisant face.","tradEn":"Reclining on them, facing each other.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront accoudés à ces lits, les uns faisant face aux autres, sans que personne parmi eux ne tourne le dos à quiconque.","explicationEn":"16. Reclining on these couches facing one another and no one will look at the back of another.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056016","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-15.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-17.html"},{"numVerset":17,"texteArabe":"يَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ وِلْدَانٌ مُخَلَّدُونَ","tradPropre":"Parmi eux circuleront des garçons éternellement jeunes,","tradEn":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Circuleront parmi eux des garçons qui seront à leur service et qui ne connaîtront ni la vieillesse ni la mort.","explicationEn":"17. Children who will never face old age or extinction will roam around them, to serve them.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056017","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-16.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-18.html"},{"numVerset":18,"texteArabe":"بِأَكْوَابٍ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأْسٍ مِنْ مَعِينٍ","tradPropre":"avec des coupes, des aiguières et un verre [rempli] d'une liqueur de source","tradEn":"With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils feront passer parmi eux des coupes (dépourvues d’anse), des vases (pourvus d’anse) et un verre de vin provenant d’une source qui coule dans le Paradis sans ne jamais tarir.","explicationEn":"18. They will roam around them holding handle-less jugs, jugs with handles, and glasses of unlimited wine that flows in Paradise.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056018","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-17.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-19.html"},{"numVerset":19,"texteArabe":"لَا يُصَدَّعُونَ عَنْهَا وَلَا يُنْزِفُونَ","tradPropre":"qui ne leur provoquera ni maux de tête ni étourdissement;","tradEn":"No headache will they have therefrom, nor will they be intoxicated -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ce vin ne sera pas semblable au vin du bas monde: il ne provoquera ni maux de tête ni n’altèrera la raison.","explicationEn":"19. It is not like the wine of the world; it’s drinkers will not get headaches nor suffer intoxication.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056019","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-18.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-20.html"},{"numVerset":20,"texteArabe":"وَفَاكِهَةٍ مِمَّا يَتَخَيَّرُونَ","tradPropre":"et des fruits de leur choix,","tradEn":"And fruit of what they select","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ces garçons feront circuler parmi eux des fruits qu’eux-mêmes auront choisis.","explicationEn":"20. These children will also roam around them with fruits, from which they may choose.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056020","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-19.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-21.html"},{"numVerset":21,"texteArabe":"وَلَحْمِ طَيْرٍ مِمَّا يَشْتَهُونَ","tradPropre":"et toute chair d'oiseau qu'ils désireront.","tradEn":"And the meat of fowl, from whatever they desire.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ainsi que toute chair d’oiseaux qu’ils désireront.","explicationEn":"21. They will also roam around with the meat of birds their hearts desire.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056021","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-20.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-22.html"},{"numVerset":22,"texteArabe":"وَحُورٌ عِينٌ","tradPropre":"Et ils auront des houris aux yeux, grands et beaux,","tradEn":"And [for them are] fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Dans le Paradis, ils auront des femmes aux grands yeux et d’une grande beauté.","explicationEn":"22. They will also have beautiful, wide-eyed women in Paradise.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056022","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-21.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-23.html"},{"numVerset":23,"texteArabe":"كَأَمْثَالِ اللُّؤْلُؤِ الْمَكْنُونِ","tradPropre":"pareilles à des perles en coquille","tradEn":"The likenesses of pearls well-protected,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Semblables à des perles préservées dans leurs coquilles.","explicationEn":"23. Like pearls protected within their shells.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056023","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-22.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-24.html"},{"numVerset":24,"texteArabe":"جَزَاءً بِمَا كَانُوا يَعْمَلُونَ","tradPropre":"en récompense pour ce qu'ils faisaient.","tradEn":"As reward for what they used to do.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ceci, en guise de rétribution pour les œuvres pieuses qu’ils accomplissaient dans le bas monde.","explicationEn":"24. As a reward for the good actions they used to do in the world.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056024","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-23.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-25.html"},{"numVerset":25,"texteArabe":"لَا يَسْمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغْوًا وَلَا تَأْثِيمًا","tradPropre":"Ils n'y entendront ni futilité ni blasphème;","tradEn":"They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Dans le Paradis, ils n’entendront pas de paroles obscènes ni de paroles qui valent un péché à leur auteur.","explicationEn":"25. They will not hear any foul language in Paradise, nor any language that incurs sin.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056025","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-24.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-26.html"},{"numVerset":26,"texteArabe":"إِلَّا قِيلًا سَلَامًا سَلَامًا","tradPropre":"mais seulement les propos: «Salâm! Salâm!»... [Paix! Paix!]","tradEn":"Only a saying [of] peace, peace.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils n’entendront que les salutations que leur adresseront les anges ainsi que celles qu’ils s’adresseront les uns aux autres.","explicationEn":"26. They will only hear the angels greeting them, and the greetings of one another.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056026","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-25.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-27.html"},{"numVerset":27,"texteArabe":"وَأَصْحَابُ الْيَمِينِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الْيَمِينِ","tradPropre":"Et les gens de la droite; que sont les gens de la droite?","tradEn":"The companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Les gens de la droite, qui sont-ils et quels sont leur éminence et leur rang auprès d’Allah?","explicationEn":"27. And the People of the Right: who are the People of the Right? Their rank and status with Allah is indeed, great!","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056027","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-26.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-28.html"},{"numVerset":28,"texteArabe":"فِي سِدْرٍ مَخْضُودٍ","tradPropre":"[Ils seront parmi] des jujubiers sans épines,","tradEn":"[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront parmi des jujubiers dépourvus d’épines et qui ne leur causeront aucun mal.","explicationEn":"28. They will be among harmless, thornless lote trees.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056028","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-27.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-29.html"},{"numVerset":29,"texteArabe":"وَطَلْحٍ مَنْضُودٍ","tradPropre":"et parmi des bananiers aux régimes bien fournis,","tradEn":"And [banana] trees layered [with fruit]","noteUnique":"<strong>Précision exégétique :</strong> Ou : d’acacias parfaitement alignés.","explicationUnanime":"Et parmi des bananiers proches les uns des autres et chargés en fruits.","explicationEn":"29. And bananas, neatly arranged in rows with one another.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056029","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-28.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-30.html"},{"numVerset":30,"texteArabe":"وَظِلٍّ مَمْدُودٍ","tradPropre":"dans une ombre étendue","tradEn":"And shade extended","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Et sous une ombre étendue et permanente qui ne disparaît jamais.","explicationEn":"30. And lengthened, continuous, unmoving shadows.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056030","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-29.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-31.html"},{"numVerset":31,"texteArabe":"وَمَاءٍ مَسْكُوبٍ","tradPropre":"[près] d'une eau coulant continuellement,","tradEn":"And water poured out","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Près d’eux coulera une eau perpétuelle.","explicationEn":"31. And flowing water which never stops.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056031","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-30.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-32.html"},{"numVerset":32,"texteArabe":"وَفَاكِهَةٍ كَثِيرَةٍ","tradPropre":"et des fruits abondants","tradEn":"And fruit, abundant [and varied],","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Il y aura aussi des fruits abondants aux variétés interminables.","explicationEn":"32. And many fruits that cannot be counted.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056032","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-31.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-33.html"},{"numVerset":33,"texteArabe":"لَا مَقْطُوعَةٍ وَلَا مَمْنُوعَةٍ","tradPropre":"ni interrompus ni défendus,","tradEn":"Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ces fruits seront disponibles à tout moment et n’obéiront à aucune règle de saison. Rien ne pourra donc empêcher ces gens de la droite de se servir en fruits.","explicationEn":"33. They will never finish, because they are not seasonal, nor will there be anything that comes in between their desire for them at any time.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056033","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-32.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-34.html"},{"numVerset":34,"texteArabe":"وَفُرُشٍ مَرْفُوعَةٍ","tradPropre":"sur des lits surélevés,","tradEn":"And [upon] beds raised high.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront sur des literies surélevées et déposées sur des lits.","explicationEn":"34. And raised spreads, spread on the couches.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056034","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-33.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-35.html"},{"numVerset":35,"texteArabe":"إِنَّا أَنْشَأْنَاهُنَّ إِنْشَاءً","tradPropre":"C'est Nous qui les avons créées à la perfection,","tradEn":"Indeed, We have produced them [i.e., the women of Paradise] in a [new] creation","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nous avons créé les houris mentionnées d’une manière extraordinaire.","explicationEn":"35. Indeed, I created the aforementioned wide-eyed women in an extraordinary way.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056035","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-34.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-36.html"},{"numVerset":36,"texteArabe":"فَجَعَلْنَاهُنَّ أَبْكَارًا","tradPropre":"et Nous les avons faites vierges,","tradEn":"And made them virgins,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nous en avons fait des vierges que personne n’a touchées auparavant.","explicationEn":"36. I made them virgins, previously untouched.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056036","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-35.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-37.html"},{"numVerset":37,"texteArabe":"عُرُبًا أَتْرَابًا","tradPropre":"gracieuses, toutes de même âge,","tradEn":"Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Elles sont douces avec leurs époux et toutes du même âge.","explicationEn":"37. They are very loving to their husbands, and equal to them in age.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056037","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-36.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-38.html"},{"numVerset":38,"texteArabe":"لِأَصْحَابِ الْيَمِينِ","tradPropre":"pour les gens de la droite,","tradEn":"For the companions of the right [who are]","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nous les avons créées pour les gens de la droite comme signe de leur félicité.","explicationEn":"38. I created them for the People of the Right: those who will be taken towards the right as a sign of their excellence.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056038","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-37.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-39.html"},{"numVerset":39,"texteArabe":"ثُلَّةٌ مِنَ الْأَوَّلِينَ","tradPropre":"une multitude d'élus parmi les premières [générations],","tradEn":"A company of the former peoples","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ces gens de la droite sont formés pour une part, de gens appartenant aux communautés des prophètes précédents.","explicationEn":"39. They are a group from the nations of the previous Prophets.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056039","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-38.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-40.html"},{"numVerset":40,"texteArabe":"وَثُلَّةٌ مِنَ الْآخِرِينَ","tradPropre":"et une multitude d'élus parmi les dernières [générations].","tradEn":"And a company of the later peoples.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Et pour une autre part, de gens appartenant à la communauté de Muħammad qui est la dernière communauté.","explicationEn":"40. And a group from the nation of Muhammad (peace be upon him), which is the last of all nations.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056040","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-39.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-41.html"},{"numVerset":41,"texteArabe":"وَأَصْحَابُ الشِّمَالِ مَا أَصْحَابُ الشِّمَالِ","tradPropre":"Et les gens de la gauche; que sont les gens de la gauche?","tradEn":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Les gens de la gauche, qui sont-ils et quels sont leur situation et leur sort?","explicationEn":"41. As for the People of the Left: who are the People of the Left? Their state and outcome is indeed, very bad.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056041","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-40.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-42.html"},{"numVerset":42,"texteArabe":"فِي سَمُومٍ وَحَمِيمٍ","tradPropre":"ils seront au milieu d'un souffle brûlant et d'une eau bouillante,","tradEn":"[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront au milieu d’un vent brûlant et d’une eau bouillonnante.","explicationEn":"42. They will be among severely hot winds and extremely hot water.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056042","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-41.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-43.html"},{"numVerset":43,"texteArabe":"وَظِلٍّ مِنْ يَحْمُومٍ","tradPropre":"à l'ombre d'une fumée noire","tradEn":"And a shade of black smoke,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils seront sous une ombre faite de fumée noire.","explicationEn":"43. And in the shadow of black smoke.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056043","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-42.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-44.html"},{"numVerset":44,"texteArabe":"لَا بَارِدٍ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ","tradPropre":"ni fraîche, ni douce.","tradEn":"Neither cool nor beneficial.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Une fumée malodorante et hideuse.","explicationEn":"44. Neither will it be pleasant, nor will it be a good sight.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056044","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-43.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-45.html"},{"numVerset":45,"texteArabe":"إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا قَبْلَ ذَالِكَ مُتْرَفِينَ","tradPropre":"Ils vivaient auparavant dans le luxe.","tradEn":"Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Avant d’être châtiés, ils étaient dans l’aisance dans le bas monde et n’avaient d’autres préoccupations que leurs plaisirs.","explicationEn":"45. Indeed, before they came to the punishment, they were enjoying the luxuries in the world, caring only for their desires.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056045","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-44.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-46.html"},{"numVerset":46,"texteArabe":"وَكَانُوا يُصِرُّونَ عَلَى الْحِنْثِ الْعَظِيمِ","tradPropre":"Ils persistaient dans le grand péché [le polythéisme]","tradEn":"And they used to persist in the great violation,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils persistaient à mécroire en Allah et à adorer des idoles en dehors de Lui.","explicationEn":"46. They used to persist on disbelief in Allah and the worship of idols instead of Him.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056046","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-45.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-47.html"},{"numVerset":47,"texteArabe":"وَكَانُوا يَقُولُونَ أَئِذَا مِتْنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابًا وَعِظَامًا أَإِنَّا لَمَبْعُوثُونَ","tradPropre":"et disaient: «Quand nous mourrons et serons poussière et ossements, serons-nous ressuscités?","tradEn":"And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ils niaient que la Ressuscitation aura lieu et en excluaient la possibilité, disant sur le ton de la raillerie: Après que nous soyons morts et que nous devenions poussière et ossements poreux, nous serons ressuscités?","explicationEn":"47. They also used to reject the resurrection, and they would say regarding it, mocking it and thinking it to be far-fetched: “What, when we die and become dust and decayed and decomposed bones, shall we be resurrected after that?”","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056047","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-46.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-48.html"},{"numVerset":48,"texteArabe":"أَوَآبَاؤُنَا الْأَوَّلُونَ","tradPropre":"ainsi que nos anciens ancêtres?..»","tradEn":"And our forefathers [as well]?\"","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nos anciens ancêtres, qui sont morts il y a bien longtemps, seront-ils également ressuscités?","explicationEn":"48. “Will our ancient forefathers who died before us also be resurrected?”","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056048","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-47.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-49.html"},{"numVerset":49,"texteArabe":"قُلْ إِنَّ الْأَوَّلِينَ وَالْآخِرِينَ","tradPropre":"Dis: «En vérité les premiers et les derniers","tradEn":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Indeed, the former and later peoples","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô Messager, dis à ces gens qui traitent la Ressuscitation de mensonge: Les premières générations comme les dernières","explicationEn":"49. O Messenger! Say to these deniers of the resurrection: “Indeed, the earlier generations of people and the later ones from them...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056049","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-48.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-50.html"},{"numVerset":50,"texteArabe":"لَمَجْمُوعُونَ إِلَىٰ مِيقَاتِ يَوْمٍ مَعْلُومٍ","tradPropre":"seront réunis pour le rendez-vous d'un jour connu».","tradEn":"Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day.\"","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"seront sans aucun doute rassemblées le Jour de la Résurrection afin de rendre des comptes et d’être rétribuées.","explicationEn":"50. “...will soon be inevitably gathered on the Day of Judgement to be taken to account and requited.”","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056050","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-49.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-51.html"},{"numVerset":51,"texteArabe":"ثُمَّ إِنَّكُمْ أَيُّهَا الضَّالُّونَ الْمُكَذِّبُونَ","tradPropre":"Et puis, vous, les égarés, qui traitiez (la Résurrection) de mensonge,","tradEn":"Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô vous qui traitez la Ressuscitation de mensonge et qui vous vous êtes égarés du droit chemin.","explicationEn":"51. Then, O you rejectors of the resurrection and deviants from the straight path!","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056051","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-50.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-52.html"},{"numVerset":52,"texteArabe":"لَآكِلُونَ مِنْ شَجَرٍ مِنْ زَقُّومٍ","tradPropre":"vous mangerez certainement d'un arbre de Zaqqûm.","tradEn":"Will be eating from trees of zaqqūm","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Le Jour de la Résurrection, vous mangerez des fruits de l’arbre dénommé Az-Zaqqûm, les pires et les plus nauséabonds des fruits","explicationEn":"52. You shall, on the Day of Judgement, eat from the fruits of the tree of Al-Zaqqūm, which are the worst and most disgusting of fruits.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056052","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-51.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-53.html"},{"numVerset":53,"texteArabe":"فَمَالِئُونَ مِنْهَا الْبُطُونَ","tradPropre":"vous vous en remplirez le ventre,","tradEn":"And filling with it your bellies","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Vous remplirez vos ventres vides de ces fruits.","explicationEn":"53. You will fill your hungry bellied with the fruits of that bitter tree.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056053","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-52.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-54.html"},{"numVerset":54,"texteArabe":"فَشَارِبُونَ عَلَيْهِ مِنَ الْحَمِيمِ","tradPropre":"puis vous boirez par-dessus cela de l'eau bouillante,","tradEn":"And drinking on top of it from scalding water","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Puis vous boirez par-dessus de l’eau bouillante.","explicationEn":"54. Then you will drink extremely hot water on top of that.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056054","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-53.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-55.html"},{"numVerset":55,"texteArabe":"فَشَارِبُونَ شُرْبَ الْهِيمِ","tradPropre":"vous en boirez comme boivent les chameaux assoiffés.","tradEn":"And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Vous en boirez autant que ce que boivent les dromadaires assoiffés.","explicationEn":"55. You will drink so much of it, just like a camel suffering from a burning thirst drinks.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056055","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-54.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-56.html"},{"numVerset":56,"texteArabe":"هَاذَا نُزُلُهُمْ يَوْمَ الدِّينِ","tradPropre":"Voilà le repas d'accueil qui leur sera servi, au jour de la Rétribution.","tradEn":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"C’est avec cette nourriture amère et cette boisson bouillante qu’ils seront accueillis le Jour de la Rétribution.","explicationEn":"56. The aforementioned bitter fruit and extremely hot water is your hospitality you will be received with on the Day of Requital.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056056","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-55.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-57.html"},{"numVerset":57,"texteArabe":"نَحْنُ خَلَقْنَاكُمْ فَلَوْلَا تُصَدِّقُونَ","tradPropre":"C'est Nous qui vous avons créés. Pourquoi ne croiriez-vous donc pas [à la résurrection]?","tradEn":"We have created you, so why do you not believe?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô dénégateurs, c’est Nous qui vous avons créés à partir de rien. Ne croirez-vous donc pas que Nous vous ressusciterons et vous ferons revivre après votre mort.","explicationEn":"57. O rejectors! I created you from non-existence, so why do you not believe I will resurrect you after you have died?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056057","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-56.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-58.html"},{"numVerset":58,"texteArabe":"أَفَرَأَيْتُمْ مَا تُمْنُونَ","tradPropre":"Voyez-vous donc ce que vous éjaculez:","tradEn":"Have you seen that which you emit?","noteUnique":"<strong>Précision exégétique :</strong> Dans les matrices des femmes.","explicationUnanime":"Ô gens, voyez-vous le sperme que vous éjaculez dans les utérus de vos épouses?","explicationEn":"58. O people! Do you not see the semen you ejaculate into the wombs of your wives?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056058","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-57.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-59.html"},{"numVerset":59,"texteArabe":"أَأَنْتُمْ تَخْلُقُونَهُ أَمْ نَحْنُ الْخَالِقُونَ","tradPropre":"est-ce vous qui le créez ou [en] sommes Nous le Créateur?","tradEn":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator?","noteUnique":"<strong>Précision exégétique :</strong> Ainsi que l’être qui naîtra de ce liquide séminal.","explicationUnanime":"Est-ce vous qui le créez ou bien Nous?","explicationEn":"59. Is it you that creates that semen, or am I the one who creates it?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056059","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-58.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-60.html"},{"numVerset":60,"texteArabe":"نَحْنُ قَدَّرْنَا بَيْنَكُمُ الْمَوْتَ وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمَسْبُوقِينَ","tradPropre":"Nous avons prédéterminé la mort parmi vous. Nous ne serons point empêchés","tradEn":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nous avons décrété que tous mourrez. Ainsi, chacun de vous vivra un temps déterminé qui ne sera ni allongé ni raccourci, et rien ne Nous empêchera","explicationEn":"60. I determine death between you; each one of you has a fixed amount of time which he neither goes beyond nor falls short of. I am not incapable...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056060","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-59.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-61.html"},{"numVerset":61,"texteArabe":"عَلَىٰ أَنْ نُبَدِّلَ أَمْثَالَكُمْ وَنُنْشِئَكُمْ فِي مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","tradPropre":"de vous remplacer par vos semblables, et vous faire renaître dans [un état] que vous ne savez pas.","tradEn":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"de changer votre création et votre apparence que vous connaissez pour vous créer et vous donner une apparence que vous ne connaissez pas.","explicationEn":"61....of changing the form and appearance that you currently hold, and recreating you into a form and appearance that you do not know of.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056061","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-60.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-62.html"},{"numVerset":62,"texteArabe":"وَلَقَدْ عَلِمْتُمُ النَّشْأَةَ الْأُولَىٰ فَلَوْلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","tradPropre":"Vous avez connu la première création. Ne vous rappelez-vous donc pas?","tradEn":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Vous savez comment Nous vous avons créés la première fois. N’en tirez-vous aucun enseignement et ne comprenez-vous pas que Celui qui vous a créés la première fois, a le pouvoir de vous ressusciter après votre mort?","explicationEn":"62. Verily, you know how I created you initially, so do you not take heed and realise that the being who created you in the first place, is capable of resurrecting you after you die?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056062","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-61.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-63.html"},{"numVerset":63,"texteArabe":"أَفَرَأَيْتُمْ مَا تَحْرُثُونَ","tradPropre":"Voyez-vous donc ce que vous labourez?","tradEn":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Voyez-vous les graines que vous semez?","explicationEn":"63. Do you see the seeds you plant in the earth?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056063","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-62.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-64.html"},{"numVerset":64,"texteArabe":"أَأَنْتُمْ تَزْرَعُونَهُ أَمْ نَحْنُ الزَّارِعُونَ","tradPropre":"Est-ce vous qui le cultivez? ou [en] sommes Nous le cultivateur?","tradEn":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Est-ce vous qui faites germer ces graines ou est-ce Nous?","explicationEn":"64. Are you the ones who make that seed grow, or am I the one that makes it grow?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056064","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-63.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-65.html"},{"numVerset":65,"texteArabe":"لَوْ نَشَاءُ لَجَعَلْنَاهُ حُطَامًا فَظَلْتُمْ تَفَكَّهُونَ","tradPropre":"Si Nous voulions, Nous le réduirions en débris. Et vous ne cesseriez pas de vous étonner et [de crier]:","tradEn":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Si Nous voulions réduire en débris les cultures qui en sortent lorsqu’elles sont sur le point de murir, vous ne cesseriez de vous étonner de cela.","explicationEn":"65. If I wish to ruin that crop, I can do so after bringing it close to ripening and harvest. You would then be left shocked at what affected it.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056065","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-64.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-66.html"},{"numVerset":66,"texteArabe":"إِنَّا لَمُغْرَمُونَ","tradPropre":"«Nous voilà endettés!","tradEn":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Vous diriez: Nous avons été punis par la perte de ce que nous avons dépensé.","explicationEn":"66. You would say, “Indeed, we lost everything we spent, and we have been punished.”","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056066","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-65.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-67.html"},{"numVerset":67,"texteArabe":"بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ","tradPropre":"ou plutôt, exposés aux privations».","tradEn":"Rather, we have been deprived.\"","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ou plutôt, nous avons été privés de subsistance.","explicationEn":"67. “Rather, we have been deprived of sustenance.”","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056067","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-66.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-68.html"},{"numVerset":68,"texteArabe":"أَفَرَأَيْتُمُ الْمَاءَ الَّذِي تَشْرَبُونَ","tradPropre":"Voyez-vous donc l'eau que vous buvez?","tradEn":"And have you seen the water that you drink?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Voyez-vous l’eau que vous buvez lorsque vous avez soif?","explicationEn":"68. Do you see the water you drink when you are thirsty?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056068","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-67.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-69.html"},{"numVerset":69,"texteArabe":"أَأَنْتُمْ أَنْزَلْتُمُوهُ مِنَ الْمُزْنِ أَمْ نَحْنُ الْمُنْزِلُونَ","tradPropre":"Est-ce vous qui l'avez fait descendre du nuage? ou [en] sommes Nous le descendeur?","tradEn":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Est-ce vous qui la faites descendre des nuages du Ciel ou est-ce Nous?","explicationEn":"69. Are you the ones who cause it to fall from the clouds in the sky, or am I the one who sends it down?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056069","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-68.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-70.html"},{"numVerset":70,"texteArabe":"لَوْ نَشَاءُ جَعَلْنَاهُ أُجَاجًا فَلَوْلَا تَشْكُرُونَ","tradPropre":"Si Nous voulions, Nous la rendrions salée. Pourquoi n'êtes-vous donc pas reconnaissants?","tradEn":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Si Nous voulions que cette eau soit très salée et inutilisable, ni à la boisson ni à l’irrigation, Nous l’aurions fait. Pourquoi n’êtes-vous pas reconnaissants envers Allah pour avoir, par miséricorde, fait descendre cette eau douce?","explicationEn":"70. If I wanted to make that water extremely bitter, such that it would be of no use for drinking nor for irrigation, I would have done so. Will you then not be grateful to Me for sending it down as palatable and a mercy for you?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056070","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-69.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-71.html"},{"numVerset":71,"texteArabe":"أَفَرَأَيْتُمُ النَّارَ الَّتِي تُورُونَ","tradPropre":"Voyez-vous donc le feu que vous obtenez par frottement?","tradEn":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Voyez-vous le feu que vous allumez pour vos besoins?","explicationEn":"71. Do you see the fire that you ignite for your interests?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056071","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-70.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-72.html"},{"numVerset":72,"texteArabe":"أَأَنْتُمْ أَنْشَأْتُمْ شَجَرَتَهَا أَمْ نَحْنُ الْمُنْشِئُونَ","tradPropre":"Est-ce vous qui avez créé son arbre ou [en] sommes Nous le Créateur?","tradEn":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Est-ce vous qui avez créé l’arbre qui lui sert de combustible ou est-ce Nous qui l’avons créé par mansuétude envers vous?","explicationEn":"72. Are you the ones who make the trees you ignite it with, grow, or am I the one who causes it to grow, being kind to you?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056072","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-71.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-73.html"},{"numVerset":73,"texteArabe":"نَحْنُ جَعَلْنَاهَا تَذْكِرَةً وَمَتَاعًا لِلْمُقْوِينَ","tradPropre":"Nous en avons fait un rappel (de l'Enfer), et un élément utile pour ceux qui en ont besoin.","tradEn":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,","noteUnique":"<strong>Précision exégétique :</strong> Puisqu’il rappelle aux hommes le feu de l’Enfer et que, plus que quiconque, ce sont les voyageurs qui ont besoin de feu.","explicationUnanime":"C’est Nous qui avons fait que ce feu vous rappelle l’Enfer et qu’il soit utile à ceux qui voyagent.","explicationEn":"73. I am the one who made this fire for you as a reminder to you of the fire of the Afterlife, and I made it a means of benefit for the travellers among you.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056073","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-72.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-74.html"},{"numVerset":74,"texteArabe":"فَسَبِّحْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ الْعَظِيمِ","tradPropre":"Glorifie donc le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Grand!","tradEn":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô Messager, nie ce qui ne sied pas à ton Eminent Seigneur.","explicationEn":"74. O Messenger! So glorify your great Lord, of everything that in unbefitting of Him.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056074","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-73.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-75.html"},{"numVerset":75,"texteArabe":"۞ فَلَا أُقْسِمُ بِمَوَاقِعِ النُّجُومِ","tradPropre":"Non!.. Je jure par les positions des étoiles (dans le firmament).","tradEn":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Allah prête serment par les lieux et les positions des étoiles.","explicationEn":"75. Allah takes an oath on the positions of the stars and their orbits.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056075","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-74.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-76.html"},{"numVerset":76,"texteArabe":"وَإِنَّهُ لَقَسَمٌ لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","tradPropre":"Et c'est vraiment un serment solennel, si vous saviez.","tradEn":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Or prêter serment par ces lieux et ces positions est sérieux, si vous connaissiez leur éminence et l'infinité des signes qu’ils contiennent.","explicationEn":"76. And indeed, taking an oath of these orbits is a great thing - if only you were to understand its greatness-, because there are uncountable signs and lessons in it.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056076","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-75.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-77.html"},{"numVerset":77,"texteArabe":"إِنَّهُ لَقُرْآنٌ كَرِيمٌ","tradPropre":"Et c'est certainement un Coran noble,","tradEn":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur’ān.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô gens, le Coran qui vous est récité est noble, en raison des avantages éminents qui s’y trouvent.","explicationEn":"77. O people! Indeed, the Qur’ān that is recited to you is a noble Qur’ān, because of the great benefits that it contains.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056077","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-76.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-78.html"},{"numVerset":78,"texteArabe":"فِي كِتَابٍ مَكْنُونٍ","tradPropre":"dans un Livre bien gardé","tradEn":"In a Register well-protected;.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Il est dans un Livre à l'abri des regards des gens et dans la Table Préservée.","explicationEn":"78. It is in a record preserved from the eyes of people, i.e. the Preserved Tablet.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056078","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-77.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-79.html"},{"numVerset":79,"texteArabe":"لَا يَمَسُّهُ إِلَّا الْمُطَهَّرُونَ","tradPropre":"que seuls les purifiés touchent;","tradEn":"None touch it except the purified [i.e., the angels].","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Seuls les anges purifiés de péchés et de défauts, le touchent.","explicationEn":"79. Only the angels, pure of sin and defects can touch it.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056079","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-78.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-80.html"},{"numVerset":80,"texteArabe":"تَنْزِيلٌ مِنْ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ","tradPropre":"C'est une révélation de la part du Seigneur des mondes.","tradEn":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Le Coran a été révélé par le Seigneur des créatures à Son Prophète Muħammad.","explicationEn":"80. It is a revelation from the Lord of the creations, on His Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him).","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056080","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-79.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-81.html"},{"numVerset":81,"texteArabe":"أَفَبِهَاذَا الْحَدِيثِ أَنْتُمْ مُدْهِنُونَ","tradPropre":"Est-ce ce discours-là que vous traitez de mensonge?","tradEn":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô polythéistes, traitez-vous ces paroles de mensonge?","explicationEn":"81. O idolaters! Do you then reject this speech, and not believe in it?","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056081","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-80.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-82.html"},{"numVerset":82,"texteArabe":"وَتَجْعَلُونَ رِزْقَكُمْ أَنَّكُمْ تُكَذِّبُونَ","tradPropre":"Et est-ce pour vous [une façon d'être reconnaissant] à votre subsistance que de traiter (le Coran) de mensonge?","tradEn":"And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Exprimez-vous votre reconnaissance à Allah pour vous avoir pourvus en bienfaits en proférant des mensonges sur Lui, attribuant la pluie à l’influence d’une étoile lorsqu’ils disent « C’est l’influence de telle étoile qui nous a amené la pluie ».","explicationEn":"82. And do you show your gratitude to Allah for the blessings He has provided you with, by rejecting Him and attributing the rain to the setting of stars, by saying, “It rained upon us due to the setting of so and so star”.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056082","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-81.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-83.html"},{"numVerset":83,"texteArabe":"فَلَوْلَا إِذَا بَلَغَتِ الْحُلْقُومَ","tradPropre":"Lorsque le souffle de la vie remonte à la gorge (d'un moribond),","tradEn":"Then why, when it [i.e., the soul at death] reaches the throat","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Lorsque l’esprit remontera à la gorge","explicationEn":"83. Why not, when the soul reaches the throat...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056083","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-82.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-84.html"},{"numVerset":84,"texteArabe":"وَأَنْتُمْ حِينَئِذٍ تَنْظُرُونَ","tradPropre":"et qu'à ce moment là vous regardez,","tradEn":"And you are at that time looking on -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"qu’au même moment vous regardez la personne qui agonise devant vous,","explicationEn":"84....and at that time, you see the dying person in front of you...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056084","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-83.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-85.html"},{"numVerset":85,"texteArabe":"وَنَحْنُ أَقْرَبُ إِلَيْهِ مِنْكُمْ وَلَاكِنْ لَا تُبْصِرُونَ","tradPropre":"et que Nous sommes plus proche de lui que vous [qui l'entourez] mais vous ne [le] voyez point.","tradEn":"And We [i.e., Our angels] are nearer to him than you, but you do not see -","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Nous, par Notre connaissance, Notre pouvoir et Nos anges, sommes plus proches que vous de votre mort. Seulement, vous ne pouvez voir ces anges.","explicationEn":"85....whilst My angels are closer to the dying person than you are, but you do not see them...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056085","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-84.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-86.html"},{"numVerset":86,"texteArabe":"فَلَوْلَا إِنْ كُنْتُمْ غَيْرَ مَدِينِينَ","tradPropre":"Pourquoi donc, si vous croyez que vous n'avez pas de compte à rendre,","tradEn":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Si, comme vous le prétendez, vous ne serez pas ressuscités pour rendre compte de vos œuvres,","explicationEn":"86. Why then, if you are not going to be resurrected - as you claim - for requital...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056086","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-85.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-87.html"},{"numVerset":87,"texteArabe":"تَرْجِعُونَهَا إِنْ كُنْتُمْ صَادِقِينَ","tradPropre":"ne la faites-vous pas revenir [cette âme], si vous êtes véridiques?","tradEn":"Bring it back, if you should be truthful?","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"pourquoi ne faites-vous pas revenir l’âme de votre mort si vous êtes véridiques? Or vous n’en avez pas le pouvoir.","explicationEn":"87....return this soul that is leaving your dead, if you are truthful? You cannot do it.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056087","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-86.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-88.html"},{"numVerset":88,"texteArabe":"فَأَمَّا إِنْ كَانَ مِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِينَ","tradPropre":"Si celui-ci est du nombre des rapprochés (d'Allah),","tradEn":"And if he [i.e., the deceased] was of those brought near [to Allāh],","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Si ledit mort figure parmi ceux qui devancent les autres dans le bien,","explicationEn":"88. As for if the dying person is one of those who hasten towards good...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056088","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-87.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-89.html"},{"numVerset":89,"texteArabe":"فَرَوْحٌ وَرَيْحَانٌ وَجَنَّتُ نَعِيمٍ","tradPropre":"alors (il aura) du repos, de la grâce et un Jardin de délices.","tradEn":"Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"il connaîtra une tranquillité jamais suivie de peine, une subsistance agréable, une miséricorde ainsi qu’un Jardin où il jouit de tout ce que son âme désire.","explicationEn":"89....he will be in such comfort after which there will be no tiring, good sustenance and mercy. He will have a Paradise in which he will live in luxury, enjoying whatever his soul desires.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056089","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-88.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-90.html"},{"numVerset":90,"texteArabe":"وَأَمَّا إِنْ كَانَ مِنْ أَصْحَابِ الْيَمِينِ","tradPropre":"Et s'il est du nombre des gens de la droite,","tradEn":"And if he was of the companions of the right,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Et si ledit mort est du nombre des gens de la droite,ne te soucies pas de son sort car il sera sain et sauf.","explicationEn":"91. And if the dying person is from the People of the Right, do not worry about their condition, because they will be in peace and security.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056090","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-89.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-91.html"},{"numVerset":91,"texteArabe":"فَسَلَامٌ لَكَ مِنْ أَصْحَابِ الْيَمِينِ","tradPropre":"il sera [accueilli par ces mots]: «Paix à toi» de la part des gens de la droite.","tradEn":"Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right.\"","noteUnique":"<strong>Précision exégétique :</strong> Autre sens : il sera accueilli par les gens de la droite par ces mots : « Paix à toi. »","explicationUnanime":"Et si ledit mort est du nombre des gens de la droite,ne te soucies pas de son sort car il sera sain et sauf.","explicationEn":"91. And if the dying person is from the People of the Right, do not worry about their condition, because they will be in peace and security.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056091","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-90.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-92.html"},{"numVerset":92,"texteArabe":"وَأَمَّا إِنْ كَانَ مِنَ الْمُكَذِّبِينَ الضَّالِّينَ","tradPropre":"Et s'il est de ceux qui avaient traité de mensonge (la résurrection) et s'étaient égarés,","tradEn":"But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Mais s’il est du nombre de ceux qui traitaient de mensonge ce que le Messager a apporté, de ceux qui s’étaient égarés du droit chemin,","explicationEn":"92. And if the dying person is from the rejectors of what the Messenger (peace be upon him) brought: the deviators from the straight path...","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056092","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-91.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-93.html"},{"numVerset":93,"texteArabe":"فَنُزُلٌ مِنْ حَمِيمٍ","tradPropre":"alors, il sera installé dans une eau bouillante,","tradEn":"Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"il sera accueilli par une eau bouillante qu’on lui servira","explicationEn":"93....then he will have some hospitality presented to him, which will be extremely hot water.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056093","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-92.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-94.html"},{"numVerset":94,"texteArabe":"وَتَصْلِيَةُ جَحِيمٍ","tradPropre":"et il brûlera dans la Fournaise.","tradEn":"And burning in Hellfire.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"et il se consumera dans le Feu de l’Enfer.","explicationEn":"94. And he will have to burn in the fire of hell.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056094","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-93.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-95.html"},{"numVerset":95,"texteArabe":"إِنَّ هَاذَا لَهُوَ حَقُّ الْيَقِينِ","tradPropre":"C'est cela la pleine certitude.","tradEn":"Indeed, this is the true certainty,","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Ô Messager, ce que Nous te narrons là est la vérité certaine et indubitable.","explicationEn":"95. O Messenger! Indeed, the stories I have narrated to you are convincingly true, in which there is no doubt.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056095","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-94.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-56-verset-96.html"},{"numVerset":96,"texteArabe":"فَسَبِّحْ بِاسْمِ رَبِّكَ الْعَظِيمِ","tradPropre":"Glorifie donc le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Grand!","tradEn":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","noteUnique":"","explicationUnanime":"Sanctifie donc le Nom de ton Eminent Seigneur et exclus toute déficience Le concernant.","explicationEn":"96. So glorify the great name of your Lord, and proclaim His purity from all defects.","precisionConsensus":"","texteLaurierPerso":"","miracle":null,"codeAudio":"056096","lienPrecedent":"sourate-56-verset-95.html","lienSuivant":"sourate-57-verset-1.html"}]};